{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink cameras and smart plug would give my existing Echo devices useful new jobs: checking on my home and controlling a lamp.",
    "The external drive with recovery coverage fits my history of buying storage and protection, although I would check whether I need more space before buying it."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Older Echo Show displays and more Fire TV sticks repeat needs I recently covered with a second-generation Show 5 and a 4K Max bundle.",
    "Echo Auto shares Alexa with my home devices, but that does not give me a reason to use it in my car.",
    "The Blink Mini package interests me, but I would choose the whole-home bundle instead; I do not currently need both camera packages."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in Alexa seems to have been taken as interest in almost any Alexa device, regardless of what it would add to my home.",
    "My streaming and display purchases seem to have been treated as reasons to buy more similar devices, even when the suggested versions are older or less capable."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent Show 5 stand purchase suggests I am equipping the display I already have, rather than looking for another display.",
    "Compatibility matters most when an item adds a useful capability, such as cameras or lamp control, instead of duplicating something I own.",
    "My earlier external-drive purchase makes storage relevant, but it does not establish that I now need a 16TB replacement."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my Alexa and practical electronics interests, but too often confuse expanding what I can do with buying devices that repeat needs I have already covered."
}"}
